        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher Reloaded is a short and relaxing arcade game with a simple goal – get the crown! Polish up your button mashing skills as you drop coins. Collect gems, giant coins, and even other people’s credit cards in your pursuit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/e32319acf5a331aebe7ee20534751099.poster.avif?t=1756989600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/e32319acf5a331aebe7ee20534751099.webm?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/e32319acf5a331aebe7ee20534751099.mp4?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, some collectibles will take you to other parts of the arcade. Collect the credit cards of other people, and hack into their accounts to steal all of their coins and gold bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/d81942ae072cdc05a813b5b8bf85d3b7.poster.avif?t=1756989600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/d81942ae072cdc05a813b5b8bf85d3b7.webm?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/d81942ae072cdc05a813b5b8bf85d3b7.mp4?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or find gallery tokens, and get ready to collect a boatload of coins and gold in a frantic clicking minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/7bb8fe422588b095f2094b5a49b7e782.poster.avif?t=1756989600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/7bb8fe422588b095f2094b5a49b7e782.webm?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/7bb8fe422588b095f2094b5a49b7e782.mp4?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealing money from people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic slot zombie experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups and collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions or AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual, grind-free, and beatable in an evening</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Pusher Reloaded is a short and relaxing arcade game with a simple goal – get the crown! Polish up your button mashing skills as you drop coins. Collect gems, giant coins, and even other people’s credit cards in your pursuit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/e32319acf5a331aebe7ee20534751099.poster.avif?t=1756989600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/e32319acf5a331aebe7ee20534751099.webm?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/e32319acf5a331aebe7ee20534751099.mp4?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, some collectibles will take you to other parts of the arcade. Collect the credit cards of other people, and hack into their accounts to steal all of their coins and gold bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/d81942ae072cdc05a813b5b8bf85d3b7.poster.avif?t=1756989600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/d81942ae072cdc05a813b5b8bf85d3b7.webm?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/d81942ae072cdc05a813b5b8bf85d3b7.mp4?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or find gallery tokens, and get ready to collect a boatload of coins and gold in a frantic clicking minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/7bb8fe422588b095f2094b5a49b7e782.poster.avif?t=1756989600\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/7bb8fe422588b095f2094b5a49b7e782.webm?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807570/extras/7bb8fe422588b095f2094b5a49b7e782.mp4?t=1756989600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealing money from people</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic slot zombie experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups and collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions or AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual, grind-free, and beatable in an evening</p></li></ul>",
